{"id": 69, "name": "Hanzo", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/f/f8/Hero691-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20250117141953", "cls": ["Assassin", ""], "specialty": ["Poke", "Burst"], "difficulty": "70", "stats": ["70", "80", "20", "70"], "lanes": ["Jungle", ""], "story": "Genius ninja in the Shadow Sect who is at the crossroads.", "skills": [{"name": "Ame no Habakiri", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_47/100_ac365435698ba11d4cea185ab07f4f01.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Damage dealt by Hanzo's Basic Attacks and skills inflicts a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dark Ninjutsu</span> on the target, up to 5 stacks. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Ninjutsu: Demon Feast</span> can only be cast on targets with full stacks of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dark Ninjutsu</span>."}, {"name": "Ninjutsu: Demon Feast", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_47/100_816e14aed8c099fb8cfa6053ca0666e5.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "The skill can only be used on targets with max stacks of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dark Ninjutsu</span>. When targeting a creep, Hanzo will immediately devour it and digest it over a period of time to recover 20% HP.\nWhen targeting the Turtle, Lord, or enemy heroes, he deals 600<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+120% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>, recovers 10% HP, and reduces this skill's cooldown by 60%."}, {"name": "Ninjutsu: Dark Mist", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_47/100_83f7dbd47c58fba79f634a31f88e0ffe.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10", "desc": "Hanzo dashes in the target direction, leaving <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">dark mist</span> in front that deals 90<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+45% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in the area every 0.5s, up to 5 times (this damage counts as Basic Attack damage but cannot Crit).\nThe <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">dark mist</span> slows enemies in the area by 40% and grants Hanzo 20% Movement Speed."}, {"name": "Kinjutsu: Pinnacle Ninja", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_47/100_12b3b6f378728e25a1ccf0952c9f84bf.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 72, "tagname": "Morph", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 24", "desc": "Hanzo charges into battle as <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Hanekage</span>, consuming 170 Energy per second. He gains 20 Energy when a nearby non-hero unit dies and 200 Energy if it's a hero. He gains 15 Energy when attacking a hero, and 45 Energy when attacking the Turtle or the Lord. When Energy runs out, Hanzo's body will be slowly drawn to <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Hanekage</span>'s position.\n\nWhile in <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Hanekage</span> form, Hanzo's body is invincible, while <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Hanekage</span> ignores obstacles and gains 50% Movement Speed and 30% Attack Speed.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again or Upon Death</span>: <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Hanekage</span> returns to Hanzo's body, recovering 16% HP and becoming untargetable during the return. If <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Hanekage</span> is killed, Hanzo will be slowed by 50% and revealed for 6s."}, {"name": "Ame no Habakiri", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_47/100_ac365435698ba11d4cea185ab07f4f01.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Damage dealt by Hanzo's Basic Attacks and skills inflicts a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dark Ninjutsu</span> on the target, up to 5 stacks. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Ninjutsu: Demon Feast</span> can only be cast on targets with full stacks of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dark Ninjutsu</span>."}, {"name": "Forbidden Ninjutsu: Soul Snatch", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_47/100_74eb2011217392bd06c2dc2cf9434731.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10", "desc": "Hanekage dashes to an enemy hero, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the target and its surrounding units after a brief delay. Each stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dark Ninjutsu</span> on the target increases the damage by 20% (surrounding units are not affected by this bonus). When the target has max stacks of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dark Ninjutsu</span>, it deals additional damage equal to 15<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+2% Extra Physical Attack)</span>% of the target's Max HP (this damage ignores 30% of the target's Physical Defense) and recovers 20% HP for Hanzo."}, {"name": "Forbidden Ninjutsu: Black Mist", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_47/100_2e6bdaf0784cffb7c0a636b77dce95e7.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10", "desc": "Hanekage dashes in the target direction, briefly knocking enemies in his path airborne for 0.4s and leaving <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">dark mist</span> in the area he passes through (recovers 200 Energy when hitting an enemy hero). The mist deals 135<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+45% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in the area every 0.5s, up to 5 times (this damage counts as Basic Attack damage but cannot Crit).\nThe <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">dark mist</span> slows enemies in the area by 40%."}, {"name": "Ninjutsu Flee: Return", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_47/100_d84a015788767e56209e80d5ee64ca8a.png", "tag": [], "cdcost": "CD: 1", "desc": "Hanekage returns to Hanzo's body and exits the Hanekage form."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots - Dire Hit", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6e5971b429e55f59cf100d8920cd7c32.png"}, {"name": "Golden Staff", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_98d1154b4f017c7b68a4071e3c5e9364.png"}, {"name": "Demon Hunter Sword", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4f63658b2ae982d7684b74fca8163014.png"}, {"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a80160d168038deb13d7d93ec41c8401.png"}, {"name": "Malefic Roar", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_282edd3dffb41e1b95b08592707ba88f.png"}, {"name": "Rose Gold Meteor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_da94005b9d67024c8f189889ba6368cb.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Assassin", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ae89ce5b37dcd804686133c8d7044430.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Thrill", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3a9b36ceebfebd89a7a79a5c386cfdda.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Master Assassin", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f9eb8ee775db1b5e42e5c7b93f1e8263.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "War Cry", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_944f7224f2c991290e978cc7fba66fbd.png", "tier": 3}], "spell": {"name": "Retribution", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2cd084a2661c121c347facb060a80377.png"}}, {"items": [{"name": "Ice Hunter's Tough Boots", "icon": "